WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.282 --> 00:00:04.662
Be remarkable!

00:00:04.884 --> 00:00:06.666
If you want to have success in business

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.161
you have to get people to want to talk

00:00:09.189 --> 00:00:10.498
about your company.

00:00:10.997 --> 00:00:12.979
You don’t have the money to spend on huge ads

00:00:13.147 --> 00:00:14.839
that go on and the Super Bowl

00:00:14.839 --> 00:00:17.033
and TV ads, radio show ads, right,

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:17.856
you don’t have that budget.

00:00:18.594 --> 00:00:20.911
You want to have success you need people

00:00:20.911 --> 00:00:22.249
to talk about your business

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.927
and that comes from being remarkable.

99:59:59.999 --> 100:00:01.399
Think about the word,

99:59:59.999 --> 100:00:00.999
remarkable.

99:59:59.999 --> 100:00:02.599
It means make a remark about something.

99:59:59.999 --> 100:00:02.065
Why should people make a remark

99:59:59.999 --> 100:00:01.265
about your company?

99:59:59.999 --> 100:00:02.065
You have to give them a reason.

99:59:59.999 --> 100:00:02.865
If you don’t, you’re dead in the water.

99:59:59.999 --> 100:00:01.932
You’re not going to achieve

99:59:59.999 --> 100:00:01.732
success with your company.

99:59:59.999 --> 100:00:03.532
You’re going to be an average or mediocre business.

